From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:11:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: brcmfmac: Say which country the firmware runs

brcmfmac registers its own regulatory domain, named "99", and keeps it
whatever country it then programs into the firmware, so "iw reg get"
shows "country 99" for the wiphy on every machine. Whether a country
hint (the access point's country, iw reg set) reached the firmware is
only visible at debug level: the set, the "already set" and the "no
code for it" paths are silent, and only a firmware refusal is logged.

Log the country and the firmware code and revision at info level when
the firmware takes it or already has it, and once when the driver has
no code for the hinted country.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 .../wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/cfg80211.c  | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/cfg80211.c b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/cfg80211.c
index b61a51dbbc..eac1261258 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/cfg80211.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/cfg80211.c
@@ -9700,9 +9700,16 @@ static int brcmf_cfg80211_update_country(struct brcmf_cfg80211_info *cfg)
 		 * As such, we force the bands to be re-set the first
 		 * time we try to set a country for real.
 		 */
-		if (err != -EAGAIN)
+		if (err != -EAGAIN) {
+			bphy_info_once(drvr, "country %c%c: no firmware code for it (%d)\n",
+				       cfg->country_alpha2[0],
+				       cfg->country_alpha2[1], err);
 			return err;
+		}
 		if (!cfg->force_band_setup) {
+			brcmf_info("country %c%c already set in firmware (%.3s rev %d)\n",
+				   cfg->country_alpha2[0], cfg->country_alpha2[1],
+				   ccreq.ccode, le32_to_cpu(ccreq.rev));
 			cfg->country_pending = false;
 			return 0;
 		}
@@ -9712,6 +9719,9 @@ static int brcmf_cfg80211_update_country(struct brcmf_cfg80211_info *cfg)
 		bphy_err(drvr, "Firmware rejected country setting\n");
 		return err;
 	}
+	brcmf_info("country %c%c set in firmware (%.3s rev %d)\n",
+		   cfg->country_alpha2[0], cfg->country_alpha2[1], ccreq.ccode,
+		   le32_to_cpu(ccreq.rev));
 	err = brcmf_setup_wiphybands(cfg);
 	if (err)
 		return err;
-- 
